  "title": "Dean Ferris: Going the Extra Mile",
  "summary": "In this episode, we have a special on-the-job interview with Casella driver Dean Ferris, of Scarborough, Maine. Dean goes above and beyond on his waste and recycling routes by greeting customers with a friendly smile, tossing a bone to the neighborhood dogs, lending a hand to those in need, and honking the horn for young Casella super fans. He commits every day to deliver quality service to his customers and embraces all aspects of our Casella core values.",
